[00:10.06] A CIDADE NO BRASIL
[00:30.00] What a wonderful world
[00:35.44] I see skies of blue
[00:40.22] And clouds of white
[00:44.28] The bright blessed day
[00:47.44] The dark sacred night
[00:50.32] And I think to myself
[00:55.34] What a wonderful world
[01:03.92] The colors of the rainbow
[01:06.82] So pretty in the sky
[01:10.08] Are also on the faces
